    - "meeting-with-government-officials"";s:8:"markdown";s:869:"Meeting of All Pakistan Marble Industries Association (APMIA) members including Senior Vice Chairman Muhammad Bilal Khan, Haji Shabbir Ahmed, Atiq ur Rehman Abbasi, Ilyas Muhammad with Secretary Industries & Commerce, Balochistan in Islamabad regarding the issues of marble industries sector, we reached to following conclusions which are hereunder;

